  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Balancing Migration Narratives in the Americas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will build on the lessons learned and opportunities identified from the first year/phase of It Takes A Community (ITAC) in 2021. The second phase campaign in 2022 and 2023 will continue to be global in scope, but also have features that engage experts and the public in live, real-time events and initiatives. These global initiatives will be leveraged to support balanced narratives about migrants and migration in a regional context to make ITAC further resonate with its audience.</narrative>
  </description>
